# AgriWheel — Cursor rules

## Design system (strict)
- Colors ONLY: Green #1B5E20, Yellow #FFC107, White #FFFFFF. No greys, gradients, or extra colors.
- Font: Poppins only (google_fonts). Sizes: title 22, heading 18, body 14, caption 12. Weights: regular + semibold only.
- Buttons: full width height 52 radius 12 — Primary (green/white), Accent (yellow/green text), Secondary (white, 2px green border, green text). Small: height 40, radius 12 (inside cards only).
- Inputs: outlined, green border, height 52, radius 12.
- Icons: Material Icons rounded/outlined, 24px.
- Spacing: 8pt grid, 16px screen padding, card radius 12, 16px between cards. Use `AppListingCard` for listings.
- Prices: green semibold, format `Rs 25,00,000` via `formatPakistanPrice`.
- Every screen: loading, empty, and error states.

## Code
- Widgets: `AppButton`, `AppTextField`, `AppListingCard`, `EmptyState`, `LoadingView` in `lib/core/widgets`. Theme in `lib/core/theme`.
- Folders: `lib/core`, `lib/features/auth`, `lib/features/listings`, `lib/features/profile`, `lib/features/chat`.
- Packages: supabase_flutter, flutter_dotenv, go_router, google_fonts, image_picker, flutter_image_compress, cached_network_image, provider, url_launcher, shared_preferences.
- Supabase: load keys from `.env` only in `main.dart`. Use `supabase` getter from `lib/core/supabase/supabase_client.dart`. Repositories in `lib/features/*/data`, not in widgets.
- Auth: go_router redirect; Provider for session (`AuthSessionProvider`).
- Maximum 20 screens. No extra features.

## Legacy
- `lib/modules/**` is mock UI until migrated phase-by-phase. Do not expand without removing duplicates.
